{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you hate complicated controls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful weapons and wipe out your enemies with just a few clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it requires luck and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009980/extras/2f614ae69ce4c43ef79f6d202ca58724.avif?t=1758227609\" width=379 height=179 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Strengthen your weapons to become stronger!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn and enhance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >automatically attack the enemies that are rushing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget to upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009980/extras/c2bb5c0b89a60c87a5c0c0e306428e36.avif?t=1758227609\" width=266 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the enhance button to strengthen your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortification requires luck, and if you're  unlucky, your weapon might break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Get Rewards!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the slot machine and get rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009980/extras/5ae6ea475b7925813097519ca5761f73.avif?t=1758227609\" width=199 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Test your luck!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancement has a chance of success, and also a chance of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are ways to gain an advantage in the odds of success or destruction.</p><p cla